          "docs": "Acceptable values for DateFormat are: \"MMM d, yyyy\" or \"d, MMM yyyy\". Acceptable values for TimeFormat are: \"H:mm\" or \"h:mm\". Default values are \"MMM d, yyyy\" and \"H:mm\" correspondingly.\r\n            Acceptable valuer for DecimalSeparator are: \".\" or \",\". Default value is point."
